{
  "title": "Particle-in-Cell（PIC）",
  "html": "<h1>Particle-in-Cell（PIC）</h1><p>プラズマPICは速度分布を代表粒子で、自己無撞着な場を格子で表現します。粒子同士のCoulomb力をすべて直接足す方法とは、平滑化・衝突性・統計誤差が異なります。</p><h2 id=\"model\">対象と代表式</h2><p>まず非相対論的・静電的なVlasov–Poisson系を考えます。代表粒子pの重みwₚ、電荷qₚ、位置xₚから格子電荷ρᵢを作ります。Sᵢは粒子形状から得る無次元割当係数でΣᵢSᵢ=1、Vᵢはセル体積です。E=−∇φとし、Poisson方程式を同じ境界条件で解きます。</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">E</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_i=\\frac1{V_i}\\sum_p w_pq_pS_i(\\mathbf x_p),\\qquad -\\nabla_h^2\\phi_i=\\rho_i/\\epsilon_0,\\qquad \\dot{\\mathbf v}_p=(q_p/m_p)\\mathbf E_h(\\mathbf x_p).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:2.7076em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span><